/**
 * Protects the application from being accessed directly.
 *
 * NOTE: The real Application bootstrap lives in /public/Application.bx (modern template).
 * cbqManager's own datasource is defined there via `this.datasources`, driven by the
 * `CBQM_*` environment variables (see .env.example). cbqManager's own store starts on
 * SQLite (zero local dependency) and can move to MSSQL by changing those vars only (ADR-0005).
 */
class {
	abort;
}
